          1317,
          1319,
          1324
        ]
      },
      "finding": "An expired raw frame or >=250ms gap intentionally causes a full black frame; the raw freshness rule is also checked at input and sink entry. This could look like black flashing if motion coincides with delayed source frames, but this review collected no source timing or images and cannot attribute the reported motion artifact to it. The original250ms guard, black clear, source TTL, mapping behavior and frame delivery remain byte-for-byte unchanged. The GTK canvas is already kept mapped across freshness changes rather than hidden/remapped."
    },
